OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested after police discover
OL,4,Adrugs worth #770,000 in Inverness
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested and charged
OL,7,Fafter drugs with an estimated street
OL,8,Fvalue of almost #800,000 were seized in
OL,9,FInverness.
OL,11,FPolice said search warrants were
OL,12,Fcarried out at addresses in the
OL,13,FKinmylies and Slackbuie areas on
OL,14,FThursday.
OL,16,FQuantities of cocaine and cannabis with
OL,17,Fan estimated value of #770,000 were
OL,18,Fdiscovered, along with a five-figure
OL,19,Fsum of cash.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
